      "message": "This was simply extracted manually from the F4 family file.\n\n* Copy over registers-stm32f4.h\n* Remove blocks that would be ignored if CHIP_VARIANT_STM32F76X was not set.\n\nI drew a hard line on not including other generic stm32f4 family code (in the non-CHIP_VARIANT_STM32F76X case) because I noticed that the section where clock registers are configured had logic that forced a preprocessor error if the chip variant wasn\u0027t matched exactly (now line 405 of this file). Thus, it was safe to assume that only the CHIP_VARIANT_STM32F76X of the f7 series was targeted.",
